  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">JRR Core Funding 2021</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Strengthening Accountability for Sexual and Gender-based Violence as International Crimes and for Human Rights Violations Affecting Children and Youth will strengthen accountability for international crimes and serious human rights violations, with a focus on sexual and gender-based violence (SGBV) and crimes affecting youth and children. It proposes to do this by expanding the availability and deployment of rapidly deployable experts with specific expertise in addressing those crimes, by deploying them to participate in international investigations and other justice and accountability processes. These deployments aim to promote efforts to end impunity for international crimes with a focus on sexual and gender-based crimes, and on crimes affecting children and youth, while enhancing the protection of survivors of those crimes.</narrative>
  </description>
